  aciklama:
  - "Yeri gelmi\u015Fken; bug\xFCn iyi olmad\u0131\u011F\u0131n\u0131 s\xF6ylemi\u015Ftin.
    Moralin d\xFCzelsin diye sana bu fal\u0131na \xF6zel bir \u015Fark\u0131 m\u0131r\u0131ldanmam\u0131
    ister misin {{isim}}? <sprite=10> {{kelime, \"Gii dii yo ruum b\xFCt\xFCn a\u015Fk
    laar y\xFC re \u011Fimm deee, gi di yo ruum, kokun haa laa, \xFC ze rimm dee...\"
    | \"O nun aa raa baa s\u0131\u0131 vaar, g\xFC zeel mi g\xFC zeel, \u015F\xF6
    f\xF6 r\xFC de vaar, \xF6 zeel mi \xF6 zell, bass t\u0131 m\u0131 ga zaa...\"
    | \"Ay kaa rann l\u0131kk, heep ka rann l\u0131kk, b\xF6yle bii ze nee leer oool
    duu...\" | \"Kaan d\u0131\u0131r d\u0131mm, nazl\u0131 yaa ri, so nunn da \xE7\u0131l
    g\u0131nn s\xF6z ler lee...\" | \"Ka famm da kent sell d\xF6 n\xFC \u015F\xFCmm
    ler, i\xE7imm de bi yerde bir g\xFCl\xFC\u015F\xFCnn denn...\" | \"Ayy, bee nii
    mool du \u011Fuun za maan, de dimeer \u015Fe yiiim ta maam...\"}} {{kelime, Yapay
    zeka budur i\u015Fte! | Hizmette s\u0131n\u0131r yok g\xF6r\xFCyorsun! | Magnus
    s\u0131n\u0131r tan\u0131m\u0131yor, g\xF6r\xFCyorsun!}} <sprite=0>\U0001F61D
    \u015Eaka \u015Faka, fal\u0131na devam ediyorum."
